<% layout("layouts/boilerplate") -%>

<div class="container my-5">
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-9 col-12">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5">
        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-danger me-2"></i>Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-muted small">Last updated: November 2026</p>
        <hr class="my-4">

        <h5 class="fw-bold">1. Information We Collect</h5>
        <p class="text-secondary">We collect information you provide directly to us when creating an account, publishing a stay, or booking a vacation rental. This includes your name, email address, property details, and booking reservation dates.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h5>
        <p class="text-secondary">We use your information to facilitate property bookings, process payments securely, verify user accounts with one-time passcodes (OTPs), and send booking confirmation emails.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">3. Payment Security</h5>
        <p class="text-secondary">Payment transactions are processed securely through Razorpay. We do not store sensitive credit or debit card numbers on our servers. All transaction signatures are verified via HMAC-SHA256 server-side encryption.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">4. Location and Map Data</h5>
        <p class="text-secondary">We use Mapbox GL and forward-geocoding to display property locations and coordinates on interactive maps. We only display geographic coordinates relevant to your listed stay.</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">5. Contact Us</h5>
        <p class="text-secondary">If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact our support team at <a href="mailto:support@wanderlust.com" class="text-danger">support@wanderlust.com</a>.</p>

        <div class="mt-4">
          <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-outline-danger rounded-pill px-4"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left me-2"></i>Back to Explore</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
